          "text": "Concerns about water and evening tea"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient expressed tangential concerns that water smelled funny and could affect her nerves, and that an extra evening cup of tea might affect her heart."
